::kind(writ)

=[ Writ: pure-external fixture ]

==[ parser-purity ]

@rule(parser-purity){
  guard: { twrit: pure }

  pure: {
    crates: list("core")
    forbid: list()
    allow-external: list()
  }
}

`core` depends on `outside`, which is not a workspace member and is not
listed. The property is that nothing new arrives without a decision.
